+## 6. Fresh non-vacuity test
+
+The reviewer-authored mutation changes the result obligation, not the program:
+
+```text
+unitDigitProduct(A,B)
+```
+
+becomes:
+
+```text
+unitDigitProduct(A,B) +Int 1
+```
